# Sibling: tiktok-mcp-connector

A clone lives at `c:\htmls\tiktok-mcp-connector` with the same Cloud Run + Claude OAuth + MCP tool pattern.

When the user works on TikTok MCP (or says "same steps as Meta"):

1. Mirror this project's deploy/OAuth/tool patterns
2. Use `TIKTOK_*` env vars and `tiktok_mcp_server.py`
